Most gracious madam,

The plan for the kitchen accounts for the quarter is settled. Pray confirm yo=
u are content and I will give the word.

Let's nip this one in the bud before it goes to the block.

Ever at your command,
Thomas Boleyn, Earl of Wiltshire

